#: ../../source/docs/troubleshooting-pixhawkpx4-boot.rst:7
#: 0f72f00ea07c4f868ae9264f9badabc5
msgid "Troubleshooting Pixhawk Boot"
msgstr "Pixhawk 启动故障排除"

#: ../../source/docs/troubleshooting-pixhawkpx4-boot.rst:9
#: e52e11b66e4045ada0ed05b038766038
msgid "This article explains how to check if the Pixhawk has booted properly."
msgstr "本文介绍如何检查 Pixhawk 是否已正常启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/troubleshooting-pixhawkpx4-boot.rst:11
#: 798542497148408d9e6e9a22cbaa42dc
msgid ""
"The following tests can help you determine if boot has failed, and possible "
"causes:"
msgstr "以下检查方法可帮助您判断启动是否失败及可能的原因："

#: ../../source/docs/troubleshooting-pixhawkpx4-boot.rst:13
#: b4f2ef5560814611a0e06e3080dd43d3
msgid ""
"Check the Pixhawk :ref:`LEDs <copter:common-leds-pixhawk>` and :ref:`Sounds "
"<copter:common-sounds-pixhawkpx4>` as these can immediately confirm a "
"successful boot. If boot fails, these can broadly indicate the point of "
"failure."
msgstr ""
"检查 Pixhawk 的 :ref:`LED 指示灯 <copter:common-leds-pixhawk>` 和 :ref:`提示音 "
"<copter:common-sounds-pixhawkpx4>`，这些可立即确认启动是否成功。若启动失败，这些信息可大致指示故障点。"

#: ../../source/docs/troubleshooting-pixhawkpx4-boot.rst:18
#: f3a80acfbc724235a23fd0b1def98f2d
msgid "Check that the board has appropriate ArduPilot firmware installed."
msgstr "检查飞控板是否安装了正确的 ArduPilot 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/troubleshooting-pixhawkpx4-boot.rst:19
#: 6f9a3c28b5224645af0f3b5770e08509
msgid ""
"Ensure the memory card is fully inserted into the Pixhawk/controller card "
"socket."
msgstr "确保存储卡已完全插入 Pixhawk 或飞控的卡槽中。"

#: ../../source/docs/troubleshooting-pixhawkpx4-boot.rst:20
#: 4fb561a568a54e1284cedfc44095d9f4
msgid "**Check the boot log:**"
msgstr "**检查启动日志：**"

#: ../../source/docs/troubleshooting-pixhawkpx4-boot.rst:22
#: 4d83b1ade8ba40b391d95fa2b74ea25e
msgid ""
"Remove the SD card from from the board and insert into your regular computer"
msgstr "从飞控板取出 SD 卡，插入您的普通计算机"

#: ../../source/docs/troubleshooting-pixhawkpx4-boot.rst:24
#: b5aaf837c606403d9b4661ee7d0c1f65
msgid ""
"open the **APM/boot.log** file and check that it contains the following "
"lines"
msgstr "打开 **APM/boot.log** 文件，检查其中是否包含以下内容"

#: ../../source/docs/troubleshooting-pixhawkpx4-boot.rst:35
#: 3974a97e30eb477aaa8267b4f3ccabb3
msgid ""
"If the file does not exist or the contents are different from above then "
"reinstall the Copter/Plane/Rover firmware."
msgstr "如果文件不存在或内容与上述不符，请重新安装 Copter/Plane/Rover 固件。"
